Package: sitemix
Title: Proportions and Sampling Uncertainty for Sites and Groups
Version: 0.3.1
Date: 2026-10-03
Authors@R: c(
    person("JoonHo", "Lee", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "jlee296@ua.edu",
           comment = c(ORCID = "0009-0006-4019-8703"))
  )
Description: Estimates proportions and their sampling uncertainty for sites and
    groups observed over time. Accepts individual records, sufficient counts, or
    published aggregate counts. Handles single binary indicators, overlapping
    binary indicators, and mutually exclusive categories. Returns estimates and
    standard errors on raw and reported scales, sample-size flags, and optional
    within-site covariance matrices. For published marginal counts, covariance
    calculations use a working-independence assumption because joint counts are
    unavailable.
URL: https://joonho112.github.io/sitemix/,
    https://github.com/joonho112/sitemix
